# Key mappings
map <down> scrollDown
map <up> scrollUp

map <PageUp> scrollPageUp
map <PageDown> scrollPageDown
map <c-d> scrollPageDown
map <c-u> scrollPageUp

map < goBack
map > goForward

unmap J
map J nextTab
unmap K
map K previousTab

unmap H
unmap L
map H moveTabLeft
map L moveTabRight

unmap W
map W closeOtherTabs
map gb visitPreviousTab
map g0 lastTab

map <c-p> Vomnibar.activate
map <c-b> Vomnibar.activateBookmarks
map <c-t> Vomnibar.activateTabSelection
map <m-p> Vomnibar.activateTabSelection
map <m-k> Vomnibar.activateInNewTab

unmap yy
map yl copyCurrentUrl
map yyp duplicateTab
